# Power BI Report Review: `veloc.pbix`

**Dashboard title:** QuickCart Operations Dashboard
**Domain:** Quick-commerce / grocery delivery (5 Indian cities)
**Data period:** 2 Jul 2025 – 29 Jun 2026 (12 months)
**Pages:** 1 (1920 × 1080) | **Visuals:** 9 | **Tables loaded:** 3 | **Measures:** 5

