AOV is almost identical across cities, so GMV differences come from order volume, not basket size.

### 5.3 Delivery time

- **Peak hours:** 08:00–09:59 (about 27.2 min) and 19:00–21:59 (about 27.2 min) are roughly 4 minutes slower than the baseline of about 23.2 min. Order volume is flat across hours, so the slowdown reflects capacity or traffic, not demand.
- **Rain:** 30.1 min versus 23.7 min on dry days (+6.5 min).
- Only 6% of GMV orders (6,124 of 99,094) were placed in rain.

